   "text": "RegExp Meta Characters"
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Regular Expression Metacharacters"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "Metacharacters are characters with a special meaning."
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "They can be used to match digts, words, spaces, and more:"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "// Match words\nconst pattern = /\\w/;"
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "JavaScript Regex Metacharacters"
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Revised July 2025"
  },
  {
   "type": "table",
   "headers": [],
   "rows": [
    [
     "Meta",
     "Description"
    ],
    [
     "\\d",
     "Matches Digits"
    ],
    [
     "\\D",
     "Matches None Digits"
    ],
    [
     "\\w",
     "Matches alphanumeric Word characters"
    ],
    [
     "\\W",
     "Matches None alphanumeric Word characters"
    ],
    [
     "\\s",
     "Matches Spaces"
    ],
    [
     "\\S",
     "Matches None Spaces"
    ],
    [
     "\\ddd",
     "Matches characters by the Octal numer ddd"
    ],
    [
     "\\xhh",
     "Matches characters by the HexadecimaL number hh"
    ],
    [
     "\\uhhhh",
     "Matches Unicode characters by the hex number hhhh"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "RegExp \\d (digits) Metacharacter"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "The \\d metacharacter matches digits."
  },
  {
   "type": "code",
   "lang": "js",
   "text": "let text = \"Give 100%!\";\n\nconst pattern = /\\d/g;\n\nlet result = text.match(pattern);",
   "caption": "Example"
  },
  {
   "type": "tryit",
   "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=tryjs_regexp_d"
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "RegExp \\D Metacharacter"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "The \\D metacharacter matches non-digit characters."
  },
  {
   "type": "code",
   "lang": "js",
   "text": "let text = \"Give 100%!\";\n\nconst pattern = /\\D/g;\n\nlet result = text.match(pattern);",
   "caption": "Example"
  },
  {
   "type": "tryit",
   "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=tryjs_regexp_nondigit"
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "RegExp \\w (word) Metacharacter"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "The \\w metacharacter matches word characters."
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "A word character is a character a-z, A-Z, 0-9, including _ (underscore)."
  },
  {
   "type": "code",
   "lang": "js",
   "text": "let text = \"Give 100%!\";\n\nconst pattern = /\\w/g;\n\nlet result = text.match(pattern);",
   "caption": "Example"
  },
  {
   "type": "tryit",
   "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=tryjs_regexp_wordchar"
  },
  {
   "type": "h1",
   "text": "RegExp \\W Metacharacter"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "The \\W metacharacter matches non-word characters."
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "A word character is a character a-z, A-Z, 0-9, including _ (underscore)."
  },
  {
   "type": "code",
   "lang": "js",
   "text": "let text = \"Give 100%!\";\n\nconst pattern = /\\W/g;\n\nlet result = text.match(pattern);",
   "caption": "Example"
  },
  {
   "type": "tryit",
   "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=tryjs_regexp_nonwordchar"
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "The \\s (space) Metacharacter"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "The \\s metacharacter matches whitespace characters like space, tab, and newline."
  },
  {
   "type": "code",
   "lang": "js",
   "text": "let text = \"Is this all there is?\";\n\nconst pattern = /\\s/g;\n\nlet result = text.match(pattern);",
   "caption": "Example"
  },
  {
   "type": "tryit",
   "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=tryjs_regexp_s"
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "RegExp \\xhh (hexadecimal)"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "\\xhh matches characters by the hexadecimal number hh."
  },
  {
   "type": "code",
   "lang": "js",
   "text": "let text = \"Visit W3Schools. Hello World!\";\n\nlet pattern = /\\x6F/g;\n\nlet result = text.replace(pattern, \"*\");",
   "caption": null
  },
  {
   "type": "tryit",
